      "description": "The editorial sub-graph — a NAMED SUB-GRAPH of the harness, OPT-IN like `sdlc`: off in every layer unless that layer lists `cat-harness.editorial` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (owner, 2026-11-10, card Q-SG-1 C, wave 2). It holds the `editorial-audits` skill package: the one-voice, devil's-advocate and integration watchers, voice reviews, readability, block density, chapter complexity, the exposition swarm drain and the production-vs-exploratory discipline. The editor, content graph, content profiles, Markdown authoring and the review skills that always-on skills cite stay in `authoring-core`. Declared FROM WITHIN in `editorial/graph.json`.",
